(number of returns with a valid warranty claim in that return channel ÷ total number of returns in that return channel) × 100,

rounded to one decimal place. Return the results with each return channel alongside its Warranty Claim Ratio, ordered from highest to lowest WCR. Use the public.returns table and assume the return channel is stored in a column named return_channel.

[Phase 1 SQL reference — use exact column names, thresholds, and formulas from this SQL where applicable]
SELECT ROUND(
