For wash trading, severity is captured through the "wash_flag" field in our manipulation signals data, with three distinct severity levels contributing numeric values as follows: Low contributes 0.1 to the score, Medium contributes 0.5 to the score, and High contributes 1.0 to the score. These wash trading severity values are weighted at 10% of the overall suspicion calculation. Cases where wash_flag is not present or null do not contribute to this component.

